WEBVTT

00:02:09.921 --> 00:02:13.759
The Blind Spot in the Rain

00:02:16.595 --> 00:02:20.265
Hey, cook. What's with this BRAI shrimp?

00:02:20.682 --> 00:02:22.559
It's got too many metal pieces in it.

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:24.770
Then don't eat it.

00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:28.190
Supply is pretty unreliable,
so it's hard to come by.

00:02:29.191 --> 00:02:30.192
Good grief.

00:02:34.571 --> 00:02:36.823
Yes, yes, just a moment.

00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:44.748
Almost forgot the Japanese pepper.

00:02:45.207 --> 00:02:47.876
Even BRAI shrimp needs Japanese pepper.

00:03:00.722 --> 00:03:02.641
<i>This is the third incident this month.</i>

00:03:03.725 --> 00:03:06.520
<i>The victims are of different genders</i>
<i>and social status.</i>

00:03:07.062 --> 00:03:08.688
<i>They don't seem to be connected.</i>

00:03:09.106 --> 00:03:11.274
Indiscriminate serial murders?

00:03:12.359 --> 00:03:16.154
<i>LDSK. Long Distance Serial Killer.</i>

00:03:16.613 --> 00:03:18.573
That sounds kind of cool!

00:03:19.157 --> 00:03:21.326
<i>Only those concerned are welcome here!</i>

00:03:21.576 --> 00:03:25.080
It does concern me!
Who do you think cleans this place up?

00:03:25.455 --> 00:03:29.084
Isn't this a job for the police?

00:03:29.459 --> 00:03:31.086
It has nothing to do with us.

00:03:31.753 --> 00:03:33.713
<i>The police are already looking into it.</i>

00:03:34.256 --> 00:03:36.717
<i>But there are many irregularities</i>
<i>about it.</i>

00:03:37.467 --> 00:03:40.679
<i>This is a video of when</i>
<i>the first victim was shot.</i>

00:03:43.974 --> 00:03:45.016
I see.

00:03:46.351 --> 00:03:47.811
What exactly do you see?

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:50.230
I don't get it either.

00:03:50.522 --> 00:03:53.108
<i>Here's the edited footage</i>
<i>for ease of understanding.</i>

00:03:55.444 --> 00:03:57.446
<i>The shot goes precisely</i>
<i>between the buildings</i>

00:03:57.529 --> 00:03:59.990
<i>without hitting any other bystanders.</i>

00:04:00.574 --> 00:04:02.242
Couldn't it just be a coincidence?

00:04:02.492 --> 00:04:05.912
Gren, you can't hit someone
in the temple by "coincidence."

00:04:08.999 --> 00:04:11.418
A hotshot sniper, huh?

00:04:13.462 --> 00:04:15.630
<i>There are several other</i>
<i>mysterious aspects.</i>

00:04:15.964 --> 00:04:18.341
<i>First off,</i>
<i>we don't know the sniper's location.</i>

00:04:18.884 --> 00:04:19.885
<i>Take a look at this.</i>

00:04:25.682 --> 00:04:28.351
<i>The shot goes through</i>
<i>this windowless building.</i>

00:04:29.895 --> 00:04:31.480
Then, how did he do it?

00:04:33.857 --> 00:04:34.941
It was the wind.

00:04:36.151 --> 00:04:40.489
The sniper was probably on the roof of
the building on the left behind that one.

00:04:43.617 --> 00:04:44.618
Here.

00:04:45.368 --> 00:04:48.538
<i>That day, the wind speed was</i>
<i>four meters a second.</i>

00:04:49.164 --> 00:04:53.627
<i>When the bullet was shot,</i>
<i>it grazed the building with no windows,</i>

00:04:54.169 --> 00:04:58.089
slipped between the buildings,
flew over the monorail bridge,

00:04:58.423 --> 00:05:00.675
<i>and hit the target right in the head.</i>

00:05:01.426 --> 00:05:04.763
That's nonsense! You can't target someone
from a place like that.

00:05:04.846 --> 00:05:05.889
It's impossible!

00:05:06.515 --> 00:05:08.767
There are cameras
throughout the city, right?

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:11.895
You're hardheaded for such a young kid.

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:13.313
I'm not a kid!

00:05:13.605 --> 00:05:15.023
Okay, Sarge.

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:17.067
It's not Sarge, it's Captain!

00:05:17.234 --> 00:05:18.777
Oh, right. I forgot.

00:05:19.110 --> 00:05:20.111
Asshole.

00:05:20.362 --> 00:05:23.114
<i>It's possible the sniper was a BRAI</i>
<i>rather than a terrorist.</i>

00:05:23.824 --> 00:05:28.203
<i>This is an official request from</i>
<i>the police, so get on it right away.</i>

00:05:28.995 --> 00:05:32.541
What about the analysis of the Dark Drive
we got a few days ago?

00:05:33.166 --> 00:05:34.793
<i>This case takes priority.</i>

00:05:36.044 --> 00:05:37.087
Understood.

00:05:37.546 --> 00:05:40.924
Then please give us permission
to access all cameras in the city.

00:05:41.174 --> 00:05:42.050
<i>I can't do that.</i>

00:05:42.342 --> 00:05:43.260
What?

00:05:43.343 --> 00:05:46.096
<i>Each department wants credit for this.</i>

00:05:46.388 --> 00:05:49.307
<i>Besides, surveillance camera access</i>
<i>is highly confidential.</i>

00:05:49.516 --> 00:05:50.976
<i>Approval will take time.</i>

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:54.563
<i>For now, make do with the data</i>
<i>we received from the police.</i>

00:05:55.063 --> 00:05:58.483
Holding back data
will waste valuable time.

00:06:00.277 --> 00:06:01.278
My mahua!

00:06:02.404 --> 00:06:03.405
<i>That will be all.</i>

00:06:05.323 --> 00:06:06.783
So, what are we going to do?

00:06:07.284 --> 00:06:09.703
We just have to analyze the data
from the police.

00:06:10.328 --> 00:06:12.664
Maybe some hacking as well.

00:06:13.498 --> 00:06:14.916
I'll pass.

00:06:16.376 --> 00:06:19.296
It may be BRAI,
but it may also be a human.

00:06:19.963 --> 00:06:22.424
Shooting a person is something else.

00:06:22.674 --> 00:06:25.885
You're the only sharpshooting expert.
Without you...

00:06:26.344 --> 00:06:30.098
I'm going to an adult establishment.
If you need something, handle it yourself.

00:06:30.181 --> 00:06:31.016
Doug!

00:06:32.225 --> 00:06:34.185
Have you heard of the Eye of the Tiger?

00:06:52.537 --> 00:06:55.373
So, Leon has been busy analyzing data?

00:06:55.749 --> 00:07:00.503
-Yeah. It's so boring.
-Well, that's nothing new.

00:07:01.004 --> 00:07:05.091
It's even more boring than usual!

00:07:05.675 --> 00:07:10.347
Remember, allow gravity to pull you from
just below your navel toward the earth.

00:07:10.722 --> 00:07:13.600
But that's too hard!

00:07:19.606 --> 00:07:21.358
What's wrong, Queenie?

00:07:22.776 --> 00:07:24.277
N-- Nothing!

00:07:24.694 --> 00:07:26.446
See? I'm doing the next exercise!

00:07:28.365 --> 00:07:30.992
XIANGLONG HOTPOT

00:07:38.291 --> 00:07:39.626
I had a feeling.

00:07:40.168 --> 00:07:44.130
According to the trajectory analysis,
the sniper should be right here.

00:07:46.049 --> 00:07:47.384
Did you find out anything?

00:07:47.884 --> 00:07:50.261
Did you know? Long ago,

00:07:50.595 --> 00:07:53.890
trajectory calculations used to be done
using rules of thumb.

00:07:59.479 --> 00:08:02.482
I don't particularly like sharpshooting.

00:08:02.816 --> 00:08:06.486
Really? But weren't you a mercenary?

00:08:06.778 --> 00:08:08.071
I was, but...

00:08:08.947 --> 00:08:12.367
our principles are much different
than that of snipers.

00:08:12.701 --> 00:08:14.035
How so?

00:08:14.577 --> 00:08:16.788
You're hired to kill people, right?

00:08:17.288 --> 00:08:19.833
We use assault rifles on auto fire.

00:08:20.208 --> 00:08:22.752
One of the bullets just happens
to kill our enemy.

00:08:24.087 --> 00:08:25.422
But those guys

00:08:25.922 --> 00:08:29.718
use a scope and can even see
their target's expression.

00:08:32.929 --> 00:08:34.305
Just one shot...

00:08:35.098 --> 00:08:36.850
and the enemy is dead.

00:08:37.350 --> 00:08:39.811
It's a completely different mentality.

00:08:41.312 --> 00:08:44.232
Your fingertip alone
leads directly to their death.

00:08:45.025 --> 00:08:48.611
Hidden in a blind spot, you take
your enemy's life in a single shot

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:51.448
without them even seeing your face.

00:08:52.615 --> 00:08:54.743
<i>Are you talking about Doug?</i>

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:59.622
<i>I want to believe in him,</i>
<i>but he won't show us his true feelings.</i>

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:03.710
<i>He's always laughing, but his smile...</i>

00:09:07.464 --> 00:09:09.424
That aim...

00:09:10.133 --> 00:09:13.386
Doug is the only one in Neo Xianglong
who has that ability.

00:09:17.682 --> 00:09:20.060
PORCELAIN PORT

00:09:23.646 --> 00:09:25.065
CHINESE MEDICINE

00:09:28.318 --> 00:09:29.527
Welcome.

00:09:32.113 --> 00:09:33.990
You come here often lately.

00:09:35.784 --> 00:09:39.079
A keel. The older, the better.

00:09:57.055 --> 00:09:59.182
Resurrecting the Eye of the Tiger?

00:10:01.726 --> 00:10:03.520
This one doesn't handle well.

00:10:06.272 --> 00:10:09.192
<i>There was an assassin's group</i>
<i>called Kiss Scene.</i>

00:10:09.901 --> 00:10:10.944
Kiss Scene?

00:10:11.778 --> 00:10:14.781
A group of contracted assassins
who'd kill anyone for money.

00:10:16.032 --> 00:10:19.244
The way they cultivate their members
is insane.

00:10:22.122 --> 00:10:24.082
<i>They kidnap children</i>

00:10:24.916 --> 00:10:29.462
<i>and create an intimate relationship</i>
<i>between them and a mother figure.</i>

00:10:31.506 --> 00:10:34.008
<i>While learning martial arts,</i>

00:10:34.217 --> 00:10:36.427
<i>long-range shooting is also</i>
<i>beaten into them.</i>

00:10:38.972 --> 00:10:43.309
<i>As the final step, they're made to shoot</i>
<i>someone with a bag over their head.</i>

00:10:45.937 --> 00:10:48.356
<i>The children surely resent this,</i>

00:10:48.940 --> 00:10:52.777
<i>yet Kiss Scene</i>
<i>forces them to kill the person.</i>

00:10:54.445 --> 00:10:57.824
Finally, they see who they've killed.

00:10:58.575 --> 00:11:01.452
Who do you think was under the bag?

00:11:03.037 --> 00:11:05.540
The woman who raised them.

00:11:06.749 --> 00:11:11.045
This is how they destroy their innocence.

00:11:19.512 --> 00:11:22.557
Wow... This is the one, old man.

00:11:27.145 --> 00:11:28.938
What's your next job?

00:11:31.774 --> 00:11:33.443
It's the curiosity of an old man.

00:11:33.902 --> 00:11:36.821
You know curiosity killed the cat.

00:11:37.113 --> 00:11:39.282
You want to live a while longer,
don't you?

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:41.451
<i>There was...</i>

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:45.538
a genius sniper by the name
"Eye of the Tiger."

00:11:49.167 --> 00:11:50.335
Eye of the Tiger...

00:11:51.127 --> 00:11:53.296
I took care of it, brainiac.

00:11:53.588 --> 00:11:57.216
I'm a captain.
Why do I have to run errands?

00:11:57.634 --> 00:11:58.676
Sorry.

00:11:59.469 --> 00:12:02.889
My classmate is a police officer,
so it's okay.

00:12:03.306 --> 00:12:06.059
You should appreciate
that I have lots of contacts.

00:12:06.309 --> 00:12:07.143
Thanks.

00:12:08.519 --> 00:12:11.481
Well, whatever.
It's the least I can do to...

00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:13.274
And you're not listening.

00:12:13.858 --> 00:12:16.778
That's not true. I appreciate it.

00:12:17.195 --> 00:12:18.529
What did you bring us?

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:20.990
Additional footage of the killings.

00:12:21.658 --> 00:12:24.160
So, what were you two talking about?

00:12:25.203 --> 00:12:26.454
Nothing.

00:12:27.830 --> 00:12:28.915
Copy complete.

00:12:46.683 --> 00:12:47.684
Emilia...

00:13:08.204 --> 00:13:09.372
Good morning!

00:13:09.747 --> 00:13:10.665
Morning!

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:12.500
That's not a proper greeting!

00:13:12.583 --> 00:13:14.460
Out of my way!

00:13:15.712 --> 00:13:17.130
<i>There's been another victim.</i>

00:13:17.505 --> 00:13:20.258
<i>This makes seven. They were shot downtown.</i>

00:13:20.842 --> 00:13:21.884
<i>That's not all.</i>

00:13:22.552 --> 00:13:24.137
<i>Due to all the victims,</i>

00:13:24.554 --> 00:13:26.681
<i>the anti-Mayor faction</i>
<i>is gaining strength.</i>

00:13:27.306 --> 00:13:30.018
<i>They don't want a</i>
<i>"Mayor who can't protect the people."</i>

00:13:30.893 --> 00:13:34.939
<i>The third victim is</i>
<i>a distant relative of Councillor Koh.</i>

00:13:35.273 --> 00:13:36.733
<i>He's leading the opposition.</i>

00:13:37.191 --> 00:13:39.819
Anti-Mayor faction? What's that about?

00:13:40.153 --> 00:13:43.072
<i>They're trying to use this</i>
<i>to bring down the Princess.</i>

00:13:43.489 --> 00:13:44.407
I see.

00:13:46.492 --> 00:13:49.787
<i>The fifth victim is a descendent of</i>
<i>Councillor Han's father's family.</i>

00:13:50.413 --> 00:13:54.459
<i>The sixth was shot near the office</i>
<i>of a councillor who's against the Mayor.</i>

00:13:55.376 --> 00:13:58.588
<i>Then this last one</i>
<i>was next to Councillor Son's office.</i>

00:14:00.173 --> 00:14:01.799
So what you mean is...

00:14:02.383 --> 00:14:05.762
<i>The more victims that are relatives</i>
<i>or members of their household,</i>

00:14:06.304 --> 00:14:08.806
<i>the more strength</i>
<i>the anti-Mayor councillors gain.</i>

00:14:09.932 --> 00:14:11.934
<i>Whoever this is,</i>
<i>that's what they're after.</i>

00:14:13.811 --> 00:14:14.645
I see.

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:17.482
This is no time to be impressed.

00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:18.608
Oh, right.

00:14:18.983 --> 00:14:20.693
<i>Only those concerned need speak...</i>

00:14:20.943 --> 00:14:24.322
By the way, did you find anything
in the data I gave you?

00:14:24.697 --> 00:14:28.701
Th-- That's right.
Leon found out something incredible!

00:14:29.035 --> 00:14:29.869
Huh?

00:14:30.078 --> 00:14:31.204
What?

00:14:31.662 --> 00:14:32.872
Don't tell me I'm wrong.

00:14:33.331 --> 00:14:36.209
I did. Of course I did.

00:14:36.459 --> 00:14:38.169
Thanks to Gren's data...

00:14:38.753 --> 00:14:41.672
I was able to deduce who was
at the scene of all the shootings.

00:14:42.548 --> 00:14:43.549
<i>You were?</i>

00:14:44.175 --> 00:14:47.136
After cleaning up the data
with multidimensional analysis,

00:14:47.887 --> 00:14:50.306
I extracted it using Ramanujan analysis...

00:14:50.390 --> 00:14:51.557
<i>Get to the point!</i>

00:14:51.808 --> 00:14:53.434
Out of the seven shootings,

00:14:53.893 --> 00:14:56.020
there was one individual at three of them.

00:14:56.813 --> 00:14:57.814
This man.

00:14:59.607 --> 00:15:00.608
That's him!

00:15:01.943 --> 00:15:04.404
He was talking to Doug yesterday.

00:15:06.781 --> 00:15:10.326
It's highly unlikely he just happened
to be at several of the crime scenes.

00:15:11.452 --> 00:15:13.413
<i>Doug is a man motivated by money.</i>

00:15:13.788 --> 00:15:16.624
<i>It wouldn't be a surprise</i>
<i>if the enemy hired him.</i>

00:15:17.583 --> 00:15:19.293
<i>I hope that's not true.</i>

00:15:19.377 --> 00:15:22.964
<i>But if Doug were the culprit,</i>
<i>that would explain everything.</i>

00:15:24.048 --> 00:15:26.926
Don't tell me that was the reason
he came to Neo Xianglong.

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:34.267
Do you think they'd hire a man like Doug
just for something like this?

00:15:34.684 --> 00:15:37.270
Could they actually be after
something else?

00:15:37.562 --> 00:15:38.855
<i>Could it be the Princess?</i>

00:15:39.689 --> 00:15:40.982
I wonder...

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:44.444
<i>I understand. I will contact the police.</i>

00:15:45.194 --> 00:15:47.530
It was me who hired him.

00:15:49.031 --> 00:15:51.242
<i>Let us be the ones to settle this.</i>

00:15:52.869 --> 00:15:57.165
Then I order Pandora
to capture Doug at all costs,

00:15:57.623 --> 00:15:59.375
even if he must be shot.

00:16:01.294 --> 00:16:03.171
Today's ceremony will be canceled.

00:16:03.838 --> 00:16:04.881
No, it won't.

00:16:05.339 --> 00:16:07.216
But, Doug...

00:16:07.675 --> 00:16:09.969
A sniper is in the city, without a doubt.

00:16:10.511 --> 00:16:11.929
Please stay out of the public.

00:16:12.597 --> 00:16:15.183
The Mayor will not give in to terror.

00:16:15.892 --> 00:16:18.060
The ceremony will be held as planned.

00:16:19.562 --> 00:16:21.939
This is my city.

00:16:22.482 --> 00:16:23.483
Princess...!

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:25.651
If it's as you say,

00:16:26.319 --> 00:16:30.072
then my absence from the initiation
ceremony for the anti-BRAI unit Pandora

00:16:30.448 --> 00:16:32.909
is exactly what the opposition wants.

00:16:35.203 --> 00:16:38.789
If the perpetrator is revealed by this,

00:16:39.165 --> 00:16:41.083
that would be convenient, wouldn't it?

00:16:42.418 --> 00:16:43.419
Princess...

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:48.799
The Princess intends to proceed
with the ceremony.

00:16:49.091 --> 00:16:50.301
How are things there?

00:16:50.718 --> 00:16:52.762
I'm headed to Doug's place now.

00:16:53.471 --> 00:16:56.140
His communicator's GPS
hasn't moved from there.

00:17:01.896 --> 00:17:04.565
That you, kid?
Do you know what time it is?

00:17:04.649 --> 00:17:05.691
<i>I'm not a kid!</i>

00:17:05.942 --> 00:17:07.610
Whatever, Sarge.

00:17:09.153 --> 00:17:12.532
<i>I hate lying,</i>
<i>so I'll get straight to the point.</i>

00:17:13.616 --> 00:17:16.410
<i>Are you behind the killings?</i>

00:17:18.704 --> 00:17:20.623
What would you do if I was?

00:17:21.999 --> 00:17:23.376
I'll show you!

00:17:26.963 --> 00:17:29.382
<i>That so? Well, give it your best shot.</i>

00:17:29.924 --> 00:17:30.925
Shit!

00:17:33.344 --> 00:17:35.972
<i>I think you're all underestimating me.</i>

00:17:37.557 --> 00:17:40.309
<i>You don't really think I'd be</i>
<i>where the GPS is, do you?</i>

00:17:42.645 --> 00:17:44.564
<i>Tell the little sis...</i>

00:17:45.273 --> 00:17:47.024
<i>I'm leaving Emilia to her for a while.</i>

00:17:50.236 --> 00:17:51.237
Rain, huh?

00:17:53.281 --> 00:17:54.282
Emilia...

00:17:55.283 --> 00:17:56.909
it was raining that day as well.

00:17:59.203 --> 00:18:01.372
You failed? This is an emergency.

00:18:01.747 --> 00:18:05.001
Contact Queenie Yoh
and do everything you can to catch Doug.

00:18:05.418 --> 00:18:06.752
At 7:00 p.m. tonight,

00:18:06.919 --> 00:18:09.922
the Princess will attend
the Pandora initiation in Ronmen Square.

00:18:15.344 --> 00:18:18.598
<i>We'll look at a four-kilometer radius</i>
<i>around Ronmen Square.</i>

00:18:18.931 --> 00:18:20.391
Expand it to five kilometers.

00:18:24.604 --> 00:18:27.189
In this area,
the number of possible sniper points is...

00:18:27.815 --> 00:18:28.983
40,000?

00:18:29.275 --> 00:18:30.860
That's way too many.

00:18:34.322 --> 00:18:36.240
This one is too open.

00:18:36.949 --> 00:18:37.950
Here, too.

00:18:38.451 --> 00:18:39.619
And here and here.

00:18:43.331 --> 00:18:45.041
This one doesn't feel right.

00:18:46.751 --> 00:18:47.918
It doesn't feel right?

00:18:49.378 --> 00:18:50.379
Here, too.

00:18:51.464 --> 00:18:52.548
Not this one either.

00:18:56.927 --> 00:19:00.640
The sniper will choose
the hardest place to be found.

00:19:01.557 --> 00:19:02.558
In other words,

00:19:02.642 --> 00:19:05.603
we need to look for
the most difficult sniping point.

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:14.820
So, Doug is at one of these?

00:19:15.529 --> 00:19:18.115
We still don't know if it's Doug for sure.

00:19:18.616 --> 00:19:19.784
Gren, take that one.

00:19:20.785 --> 00:19:22.995
Queenie, head to that one by air.

00:19:24.246 --> 00:19:26.415
Leon and I will head to the venue.

00:19:35.925 --> 00:19:36.926
Emilia...

00:19:37.843 --> 00:19:39.512
It's not Doug, is it?

00:19:47.561 --> 00:19:49.772
Heavens, my suit is soaked.

00:19:49.855 --> 00:19:53.359
Was it really necessary to hold
a ceremony on a day like this?

00:19:53.651 --> 00:19:58.030
Her father was quite headstrong,
and his daughter is quite something, too.

00:19:58.322 --> 00:19:59.532
<i>In comparison,</i>

00:19:59.907 --> 00:20:03.327
Edgar Kim was great.
He was much more accommodating.

00:20:03.494 --> 00:20:06.455
Yeah, he was easy to work with.

00:20:07.581 --> 00:20:11.001
Have you heard?
Apparently, Kim's son is returning.

00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:15.339
Well,
I'm sure his son will join forces with us.

00:20:15.673 --> 00:20:18.843
<i>If that happens, it'll be our time again!</i>

00:20:22.012 --> 00:20:25.099
<i>The Mayor has arrived.</i>
<i>Heading to the stage now.</i>

00:20:25.683 --> 00:20:26.517
<i>Roger that.</i>

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:29.395
<i>We will now have a word</i>

00:20:29.603 --> 00:20:33.899
<i>from the Mayor of Neo Xianglong,</i>
<i>Cecile Soo.</i>

00:20:34.775 --> 00:20:36.777
<i>Gren here. No sign of the suspect.</i>

00:20:37.403 --> 00:20:40.281
<i>Damn! This wasn't the place.</i>
<i>He's not here!</i>

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:42.366
Kenpō master, how about you?

00:20:44.285 --> 00:20:45.995
Arriving in 25 seconds.

00:20:47.246 --> 00:20:50.708
Nights living in fear of the BRAI
are a thing of the past.

00:21:00.843 --> 00:21:03.387
An anti-BRAI defense team,

00:21:03.888 --> 00:21:05.723
Pandora, has been formed.

00:21:06.932 --> 00:21:09.685
With this force, we aim to protect

00:21:10.394 --> 00:21:13.981
the city of Neo Xianglong
from the ever-evolving BRAI.

00:21:27.119 --> 00:21:28.120
I found him!

00:22:01.278 --> 00:22:03.447
Princess!

00:22:03.614 --> 00:22:04.615
Princess!

00:23:46.884 --> 00:23:50.346
EYE OF THE TIGER

00:23:50.429 --> 00:23:51.930
Subtitle translation by Amanda Miller
